# Assisted circuit verification
logicgates.learning.requirements = Required components
logicgates.learning.requirementsHelp = Exact quantity per component. Blank is unrestricted; zero forbids it. All components in the submitted area count, including disconnected ones. Maximum per field: 16384.
logicgates.learning.noRestrictions = All component quantities are unrestricted.
