logicgates.learning.tableHelp = Optional. One combination per line: inputs -> outputs. AND example: 00 -> 0; 01 -> 0; 10 -> 0; 11 -> 1 (use separate lines). Include every combination. Up to 6 levers, 4 lamps and 2048 logical components. I1/I2 and O1/O2 follow local positions by X, then Y, then Z; the first bit is I1/O1. Explain that order in the statement. Leave blank to check quantities only.
logicgates.learning.verify = VERIFY CIRCUIT
logicgates.learning.verifying = Checking the submitted revision. Grading remains manual.
logicgates.learning.verificationReady = Verification complete. Read the report; score and feedback were not changed.
